{"id": null, "n": "0002001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002001", "type": "orig", "text": "一及二為錫蘭本所無。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0003002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0003002", "type": "orig", "text": "Khuddaka-pāṭhā VII 之文相同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0004003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0004003", "type": "orig", "text": "見 Avadānasataka no. 49。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005004", "type": "orig", "text": "同於俱舍論分別世品第八之頌文：「我夜生五子，隨生皆自食，晝生五亦然，雖盡而無飽。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0006005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0006005", "type": "orig", "text": "參照本生經第三五二、善生居士本生故事（南傳藏三二、六頁以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0007006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0007006", "type": "orig", "text": "一及二為錫蘭本所省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0008007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0008007", "type": "orig", "text": "本生經第四三九 Catudvārajātaka 之 Mittavindaka 相類似。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0009008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0009008", "type": "orig", "text": "一及二為錫蘭本所省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0010009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0010009", "type": "orig", "text": "參照本生經第三五四、蛇本生故事（南傳藏三二、一九頁以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0013001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0013001", "type": "orig", "text": "緬甸本及錫蘭本皆省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0016002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0016002", "type": "orig", "text": "底本缺此一節，以緬甸本有以附加之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0019003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0019003", "type": "orig", "text": "此一句在錫蘭本中有的省略。緬甸本：唯有「有怒氣而又麤惡」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0021004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0021004", "type": "orig", "text": "在錫蘭本中有的省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0021005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0021005", "type": "orig", "text": "可參照 Jātaka no. 454 Ghatajātaka 但本節十二～十五文缺。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0021005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0021005", "type": "mod", "text": "可參照 Jātaka no. 454 Ghatajātaka 但本節十二【南傳】，～十五文缺。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0024006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0024006", "type": "orig", "text": "錫蘭本有的省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0024007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0024007", "type": "orig", "text": "錫蘭本及緬甸本有的省略。與 Dh. v. 127 同文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0025008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0025008", "type": "orig", "text": "闇陀迦頻陀為權商之女所住之城。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0026009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0026009", "type": "orig", "text": "可參照 Jātaka. Vol. IV, PP. v. 83-84（no. 454, Ghatajātaka）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0027010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0027010", "type": "orig", "text": "緬甸本省略。與 Dh. v. 125 同文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0033011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0033011", "type": "orig", "text": "錫蘭本有的省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0035012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0035012", "type": "orig", "text": "British museum 之原本省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0037013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0037013", "type": "orig", "text": "錫蘭本有的省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0051001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0051001", "type": "orig", "text": "此一句緬甸本續在一之下面。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0053001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0053001", "type": "orig", "text": "第一句為錫蘭本所無。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0054002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0054002", "type": "orig", "text": "第一句與前頌相結合。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0056003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0056003", "type": "orig", "text": "之第一句，錫蘭本中有而省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0056004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0056004", "type": "orig", "text": "之第一句，錫蘭本中有而省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0058005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0058005", "type": "orig", "text": "「達磨波羅」之註釋書中，以四九之前半歸屬於四八中，文應如是，今依底本，由此以下至五〇，註釋書有一半不同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0059006", "type": "orig", "text": "「見此有幸者」之一句，有歸屬於六一者，文應如是，今從底本。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0059007", "type": "orig", "text": "此句有省略者，今依原本。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0061008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0061008", "type": "orig", "text": "此節或係誤入。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0062009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0062009", "type": "orig", "text": "緬甸本及錫蘭本中，有的省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063010", "type": "orig", "text": "「等同黑雲色，尖端有光輝」有歸屬一〇之中者，然此亦可。一〇之連根伸水中，「樹下有日蔭」有歸屬於一四之中者，然此亦可。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0065011", "type": "orig", "text": "三三～三五之號碼之標法與底本及『達磨波羅』註釋書相異，後者以此為四，由三五之後半為三六之始。由意義上比較合宜。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067012", "type": "orig", "text": "在緬甸本，Bibliothique Nationale 本中省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067013", "type": "orig", "text": "一～三在 Bibliothique Nationale 本中省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067013", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0067013", "type": "mod", "text": "一【南傳】，～三在 Bibliothique Nationale 本中省略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0068014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0068014", "type": "orig", "text": "此句底本缺。由「達磨波羅」註釋書中補入。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0070015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0070015", "type": "orig", "text": "此節有全省者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005a0301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0005a0301", "type": "add", "text": "厄【CB】，卮【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0021a1101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0021a1101", "type": "add", "text": "徘【CB】，排【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0063a0101", "type": "add", "text": "眺【CB】，朓【南傳】"}
